{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":7},"Un village dans le vent","Un village dans le vent – film choral dans lequel la parole de l’un est prolongée par celle d’un autre – dresse le portrait de Burdignes , vaste commune de trois cent cinquante habitants, située sur le territoire du Parc naturel régional du Pilat, dans la Loire. La construction, volontairement poétique, de ce documentaire de soixante-dix-huit minutes emporte le spectateur en un tango d’émotions et de découvertes.",[4,5,6],"rural","ecology","self-employment",{"type":8,"id":9,"slug":10,"title":11,"release":13,"filmType":17,"directors":18,"genre":26,"media":29,"synopsis":32,"production":33,"characters":36,"roles":37,"awards":42,"tags":3},"Film","FR2018_115","fr2018-115-un-village-dans-le-vent",{"native":1,"english":12},"",{"type":14,"date":15,"year":16},"Theatrical release","2018-07-04",2018,"Documentary",[19],{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Jean-Louis Gonterre","jean-louis-gonterre",0,"Male identifying","France",[],[27,28],"Documentary – Observational mode","Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":30,"trailerUrl":31},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/89/225/188761/format_page/un-village-dans-le-vent.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OFmmLguvxyg",{"native":2,"english":12},[34],{"country":24,"share":35},"Majority coproducer",[],[38],{"person":39,"role":41},{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":40},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
